# Normalise to LF in the repository.
#
# content/portfolio.json holds case-study HTML whose line endings end up in
# the database. Letting Git hand out CRLF working copies on Windows makes the
# content diff report phantom changes on every project. The scripts normalise
# defensively too (see normalizeText in scripts/lib/content.mjs), but keeping
# LF in the tree stops the problem at the source.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
